Code coverage no longer counts test code. Inline `#[cfg(test)]` modules, bare `#[test]` functions, test-only helpers and fault injection are now excluded from the report, and the `--ignore` globs have been corrected so that `test/` directories, `test.rs` and `*_test.rs` files are dropped as they were always meant to be. Reported coverage will change noticeably, since test-only code is no longer part of the calculation.
